<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Areas</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>areas
areas all
areas all continent
areas continent
areas &lt;continent&gt;
areas donation
areas non donation
</pre>
<p>Lists the areas of Valhalla and the continent each lies on. An area marked * 
was a donation area in the days when some areas were for donors only; today 
every area is free to everyone. <a cmd='#'>areas</a> alone shows the options:
</p>
<ul><li><b>areas all</b>: every area.</li>
<li><b>areas all continent</b>: every area, by continent.</li>
<li><b>areas continent</b>: the continents there are.</li>
<li><b>areas &lt;continent&gt;</b>: the areas on that continent.</li>
<li><b>areas donation</b> and <b>areas non donation</b>: only those that were, or weren't, donation areas.</li></ul>
<p>The words can be shortened, as in <a cmd='#'>areas cont</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Map</a>
</pre>




</div>